      <section id="sect-00002">
      <title>Video: Graphing Exponential Functions</title>
      <para id="para-00032">Watch the following video to learn more about graphing exponential functions.</para>
      <media alt="Placeholder for Alt Text">
        <iframe width="660" height="371.4" src="https://k12.openstax.org/contents/raise/resources/2e4579dad761a34795c42564577ce2c33577f7de"/>
